5. Contributions

Before deploying a modified version of Venticode for production use, submit the
changes to the official repository at https://github.com/alexpacio/venticode
through a pull request. The maintainer's acceptance or merge of the pull
request is at their discretion and is not a condition of production use.
Testing and evaluation of modifications may take place before submission.

By submitting a patch intended for inclusion, you grant the Licensor a
worldwide, perpetual, irrevocable, non-exclusive, royalty-free and sublicensable
